## coding: utf-8
## Nerves VM args

## Heartbeat - restarts the VM if it stops responding
-heart

## Crash dump location
-env ERL_CRASH_DUMP /data/crash.dump

## Embedded mode - faster startup, no dynamic code loading
-mode embedded
-code_path_choice strict

## Use Elixir's IEx instead of the Erlang shell
-user Elixir.IEx.CLI

## Load the IEx config for Nerves helpers
-dot-iex /etc/iex.exs
